invalid type: string "Wi-Fi connected but no internet\nCategory: Network\nKeywords: wifi, no internet, internet illa\n\nSymptoms:\nWi-Fi shows connected but pages do not load.\n\nTroubleshooting Steps:\n1. Toggle Wi-Fi off and on.\n2. Forget the network and reconnect.\n3. Run: ipconfig /release then ipconfig /renew.\n4. Restart the router or try another network.", expected a booleanÿUxÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ